give @p written_book[written_book_content={title:"Angling in the Fishing Frontier",author:"Booty Beard",generation:0,pages:[[{"text":"Welcome to the ","shadow_color":-1,"bold":false,"underlined":false},{"text":"\nFishing Frontier!\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"aqua","bold":true,"italic":false,"underlined":true},{"text":"This book will be your guide for getting geared up to explore every river, lake, and ocean in your world. You'll be able to net the most dangerous catch, dredge the depths for lost treasures and more.","shadow_color":-1,"bold":false,"underlined":false}],[{"text":"Table of Contents\n","bold":true,"underlined":true},{"text":"Enchantments\n","color":"light_purple","bold":false,"italic":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":3}},{"text":"Fisherman's Gear\n","color":"gold","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":11}},{"text":"Water Fishing\n","color":"blue","bold":true,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":15}},{"text":"Fish\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":15}},{"text":"Junk\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":20}},{"text":"Treasure\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":21}},{"text":"Live Catch\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":24}},{"text":"Regional Catches\n","color":"gold","bold":true,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":30}},{"text":"Lava Fishing\n","color":"dark_red","bold":true,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":45}},{"text":"Fish\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":46}},{"text":"Junk\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":55}},{"text":"Treasure\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":61}},{"text":"Live Catch\n","bold":false,"underlined":false,"click_event":{"action":"change_page","page":62}}],[{"text":"New Enchantments\n\n","color":"light_purple","underlined":true},{"text":"Fireproof Line\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"red","bold":true,"underlined":false},{"text":"Add this to your fishing rod to gain access to Lava Fishing. It's exactly like normal fishing, but with a distinct smokey flavor! Don't forget to see what's swimming in the Nether!","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false,"italic":false,"underlined":false}],[{"text":"Live Catch\n\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"dark_aqua","bold":true},{"text":"This enchantment gives you the ability to fish up live mobs! There are vanilla and unique mobs that have special loot. Max level is III. It is mutually exclusive with Treasure Hunter.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],[{"text":"Treasure Hunter\n\n","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"gold","bold":true},{"text":"This enchantment puts some extra weight on your bobber, letting you hook sunken treasure! Pull up all kinds of loot crates. Max level is III. Treasure charts are shown on the next pages. Mutually exclusive with Live Catch.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],[{"text":"Some ","color":"black","bold":false},{"text":"Treasure Hunter","shadow_color":-7697782,"color":"gold"},{"text":" locations are only available in lava. Most higher tier crates are dedicated to getting renewable armor trims.\n\n\n","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black"},{"text":"Tier 0: \n\n4 types of crates","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],[{"text":"Tier 1:\n\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"gold"},{"text":"3 types of Uncommon Crates\nUncommon Crate (Ocean Biomes in Rain)\nOceanic Silt (Ocean Biomes in Rain)\nAncient Gravel (Inside Trail Ruin)\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"gold"}],[{"text":"Tier 2:\n\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#1499FF"},{"text":"4 Types of Rare Crates\nRare Crate (Inside Pillager Outpost)\nRare Crate (Jungle Biomes)\nRare Crate (Inside Desert Pyramid)\nRare Crate (Inside Stronghold)\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#1499FF"}],[{"text":"Tier 3:\n\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"dark_purple"},{"text":"2 Types of Epic Crates\nEpic Crate (Inside Shipwreck)\nEpic Crate (Inside Nether Fortress)\nEpic Crate (Nether Biomes)\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"dark_purple"}],[{"text":"Tier 4:\n\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#27A800"},{"text":"Legendary Crate (Everywhere, more likely in the end)\nLegendary Crate (Bastion Remnant)\nLegendary Crate (Woodland Mansion)\nLegendary Crate (Ancient City)\nLunch Box Common Crate\nOld Tackle Box\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#27A800"}],[{"text":" Fisherman's Gear\n","shadow_color":-6710887,"color":"gold","bold":true},{"text":"\nThe Fisherman’s Gear armor set is the core progression system of the pack, and how you advance your fishing experience! Each piece gives you one luck (stacking), and each higher luck count unlocks the next gear piece and loot tier!","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black","bold":false}],{"text":"For example, with Fisherman's Boots and Fisherman's Leggings on, you will have 2 luck, allowing you to catch items in tier 0, 1, and 2!\nWith only one piece, you only have access to to tier 0 and 1.","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black"},{"text":"With 4 pieces of Fisherman's Gear in total, you're welcome to customize the trim, dye the gear, and give it any enchantments you want! \n\nFish in your own fashion!","shadow_color":-1,"color":"black"},[{"text":"The tiers of fishing are organized by color for easier reference. \n\n","color":"black"},{"text":"tier 0 - black\n","hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":[{"text":"","color":"black"}]}},{"text":"tier 1 - yellow\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"gold"},{"text":"tier 2 - aqua\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"#1499FF"},{"text":"tier 3 - dark purple\n","shadow_color":-1842205,"color":"dark_purple"},{"text":"tier 4 - green\n","shadow_color":-184220